## 🩵 Troubleshooting

| Issue | Solution |
|--------|-----------|
| **Browsers missing** | Run `npx playwright install --with-deps` |
| **Permission denied in Docker** | Add `RUN chmod -R a+rwx /app` in your Dockerfile |
| **Report not visible in CI** | Make sure you mount the report folder: `-v $(pwd)/playwright-report:/app/playwright-report` |
| **Tests flaky or timing out** | Increase timeout in `playwright.config.ts` or use explicit waits |

